WEBVTT

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.140
What is this so late at night?

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.820
This light...!

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.290
Wilbell-san? Wilbell-san!

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.670
Wilbell-san. Wilbell-san.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.500
This is bad, I have to do something!

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.010
Wilbell-san...

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.570
Listen up, everyone.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.860
All of our assignments this period...

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:21.030
...are complete!

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:22.240
Complete?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:22.910
Complete?

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.740
Complete?

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:24.540
Complete?

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:27.330
So starting tomorrow...

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.500
Free time!

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.100
Free time?

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:31.210
That's right, free time!

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:36.550
Until we receive a new job, we're free to do whatever we want!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:42.390
But what should we do with our newly found freedom?

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.770
I already know what I'm going to do.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.890
Sleep like a log every day!

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.230
Hold it right there!

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.230
W-Who are you?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:58.900
Wilbell-san!

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.950
Why are you here?

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:03.730
That's right.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.870
I thought I told you not to cause any trouble!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.060
No need to be so uptight today.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:15.460
After all, I, Wilbell-sama, have really great news for you!

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.430
Really great news?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.130
It's called-

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.010
Wilbell presents:

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.930
The secluded springs tour with the R&D division!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:28.180
Let's look for the fabled hot springs in the Searing Wastes!

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:30.590
Huh?

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:33.400
In other words, we are all going on a hot springs trip!

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.790
A hot springs trip with everyone?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.500
Hot springs. That's right.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.610
It's the fountains of temptation.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:46.990
It's a naturally warm bath where one can heal their fatigue and soothe their soul after a long day of work and battles.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.720
Just by entering it, life long illnesses and other diseases are cured.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:53.540
It even improves blood circulation and remedies stiff shoulders.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.630
Ah, refreshing.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:04:01.170
The opportunity to bathe in an unusual environment provides you the utmost comfort.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.770
It has a great view and it'll probably feel great.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.180
I want to go.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.500
But I've already decided to sleep.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.640
So I won't be going.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.060
Are you sure you should be saying that?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:13.980
Huh?

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:20.190
One of the Searing Waste's hot springs is
rumoured to provide a rejuvenating effect.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.320
When you enter, it'll shave ten years off.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.580
It'll bring back your youthfulness.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:31.620
You can go back to a time when your skin was smooth and shiny.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.330
Youth is amazing, youth is best!

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:39.460
Everyone, let's gather at the balloon platform tomorrow!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:45.390
Logy-kun, tell Awin-kun to tune up the balloon to peak condition within the day!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:45.720
Huh?

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.380
Linca, prepare for travel as well!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:48.970
Okay...

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.680
Be ready for us, fabled hot spring!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.560
Let's soak ourselves in the springs the whole break!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.020
Let's go, everyone!

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.980
Yay!

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.650
Once more!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.800
Yay!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.440
Good, that's everyone!

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.070
It's been so long since I've travelled with Marion-san and the others,

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.790
so this brings back fond memories.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:15.170
Pyjamas, towel, snacks, tooth brush,

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.710
a bomb, a craft, and an ice bomb...

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.760
Hey, what's the big idea?!

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.980
And you need this as well!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.470
Omega craft?!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.420
You want me to bring a powerful item like that?!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.090
Just in case, just in case.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.270
That's a lot of luggage, Escha-senpai.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.760
Why are you taking so much stuff?

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.520
Because Wilbell-san...

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:42.660
Yeah.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.600
Wilbell?

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.280
Ah, everyone is here.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.870
Looks heavy!

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.490
Well then, let's go!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.910
The unexplored ruins are so close!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.170
Oh, you're right!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.970
It's surprisingly large!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:16.820
Now that you mention it, I heard that the Colseit branch was created to explore those ruins.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:19.020
Though, nobody has been able to yet.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.820
But I will go there!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.820
One day, for sure!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.200
Everyone, we're passing the mountains.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.590
They're so big!

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:33.910
Smoke's coming out.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.490
So that's a volcano...

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.080
It's my first time seeing one.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.920
I can feel power.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.290
Without a doubt, our objective is over there.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.600
We've almost made it...

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.570
...to the rejuvenating hot springs!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.090
That's a lot of steam.

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.280
It's hot, isn't it?

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:56.520
Yeah!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:57.210
Where are the hot springs?

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.060
This isn't the place.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.520
The hot springs are up ahead, at the foot of that volcano.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:03.520
Everyone!

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.720
Let's head to the foot of that volcano!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.740
I-It's heavy.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.760
Are we almost to the hot springs yet?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.950
Oh, is that it?

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.410
Nope.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.870
That's just an ordinary hot spring.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.060
Ordinary hot spring?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.380
I'm already drenched in sweat.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.700
Wilbell-san, I don't care where, I just want to enter a hot spring already.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.650
We're almost there, just hang on!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.940
That's right, Escha-chan!

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.790
Just because you're young doesn't mean you can slack!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:34.510
But!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.520
Escha, I'll carry your bag for you.

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:42.730
T-Thank you very much!

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:53.070
We're this close to the volcano?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.820
How is it?

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.660
I feel a lot of power.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.150
Marion!

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.410
I've found the hot springs!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:00.860
Eh?

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.040
Ah, hold on!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:06.000
The power here is even stronger!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.860
Then this is the place, isn't it?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.590
We're finally here, the hot springs of youth!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.470
We're finally here!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.940
But don't enter yet!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.680
We have to check a few things first.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.940
No, I will wait no longer!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.520
Coming here has drained my youth enough already!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.730
We have to recover that first!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.880
Go right ahead, chief.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:28.920
We'll go set up the tent over here.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.600
You have my thanks!

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.860
Ah, wait up you two!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.780
Ah.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.600
Shall we enter the springs, Wilbell?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.410
Wait...

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.950
All right now.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:48.130
Feels great!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.970
It's warm!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.440
How refreshing.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.570
My body's exhaustion is fading away.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.100
Nice hot bath.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.980
Geez... I told you guys to wait...

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.800
Oh well!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.110
It feels great anyway!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.110
Maybe I'll take a quick swim while I'm at it.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.900
There goes one year!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.010
There goes two years!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.030
There goes three years!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.490
Do you want to be young that badly?

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.340
Um, Senpai?

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:25.260
I have a question.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.620
What is it, Lucielle-chan?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:31.300
What can I do to become larger?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.590
Eh? Larger?

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:37.950
You have a sharp eye to be asking Escha that question, Kouhai-chan.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.580
I want to ask you the same thing, Escha-chan.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.230
How do you become so large?

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.430
Wait, not you too, Nio-san!

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.780
It's pretty simple.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:46.720
Eh?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:49.360
You just need to eat and exercise properly.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:52.690
I'll show you the exercises I usually do.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.670
First, tense your pectoral muscle.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.610
What a pain.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:05.200
Instead of that, using magic to make your chest huge is much faster!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.710
Like pow.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.230
I also heard that massaging them is good, right?

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.650
There's no technique like that, Nio-san!

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:12.620
Oh no!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:13.460
Geez!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:18.330
Um, what are you guys talking about?

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.680
W-What are we...?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.700
That's not it!?

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:25.770
No, that's not it!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.220
I'm talking about height!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.840
Height?!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.820
W-Who was the one who first misunderstood?!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.930
That was you, Escha.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.070
Definitely you, Escha-chan.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.580
It was me!

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.940
Geez, Escha-senpai!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.380
No, you're wrong, Lucille-chan!

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.620
It's just a figure of speech!

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.670
I'm sorry!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.960
It wasn't a discussion about muscle after all.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.910
There we go.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.960
Sorry about dragging you along on the R&D Division's vacation, Awin.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.550
Don't worry about it.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:12.240
Exploring the end of the world with my balloon is actually a dream of mine.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:15.680
I think of this as a practice run which makes it fun.

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:17.440
The end of the world...

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.020
Your dream's pretty dated.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:20.960
But it's still my dream.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:22.990
I'm not your ordinary balloon technician.

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:27.700
But won't it be quite challenging to travel so far with that balloon?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:32.080
Fuel efficiency is a problem, and it's probably not strong enough to withstand a long journey.

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.450
You sure know your stuff.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.170
Are you also someone who wants to explore the skies?

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.930
No, not really.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.870
Anyone would know this.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.180
Really?

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:50.720
I don't think people would know without knowing a lot about balloons.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.100
I don't really know that much.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:57.550
But if you are interested, you should join the Maintenance Division.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.190
We'd be glad to have someone like you, Logy.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.330
Yeah.

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:06.490
Hey, hasn't it been getting hotter?

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.890
Now that you mention it, it does feel like the temperature's gone up.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.470
Don't tell me...

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:16.010
Eh? Something's rumbling.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.190
It's coming after all!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.400
Eh? What is?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.410
It's..!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:19.870
It's?

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:20.580
It's...!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.750
It's?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:22.470
Eh?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:27.430
Who dares trespass on my sacred grounds?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.130
Everyone!

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.270
What happened?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.880
I-It came out of the hot spring!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.190
A red monster!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.570
A monster?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.110
What is that thing?

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:46.620
The Fire Lord.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:48.790
Fire Lord?

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.950
Drawing power from fire makes it the strongest spirit!

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.800
I've been waiting for this!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:57.840
Fire Lord!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.210
Make a contract with me!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.560
C-Contract?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.970
What do you mean by contract, Wilbell-san?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.180
Onee-chan mentioned this.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:12.490
That was with the Wind Lord, though.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:13.690
I see.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:15.310
So you're a mage.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.690
I have my reasons.

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:20.690
Let's get this over with as quickly as possible.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.150
Shut up!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:28.450
Even if you are a mage, I'll never bow down to a mere human!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:38.510
You're as bad tempered as the legends say.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.400
I guess I have no choice but to fight.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.300
Escha, it's time to use that bomb!

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:45.480
Eh?

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.970
Wait a second, Wilbell!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.760
Was meeting this spirit your true objective this entire time?

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:51.930
Eh?

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.020
It sure was.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:54.930
Teehee.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.730
Don't "Teehee" me!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.740
But my great-great-grandmother...

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:01.430
...contacted me out of the blue!

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:02.480
Wilbell-san.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.390
I haven't been receiving reports on your training's progress lately.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.100
How have you been doing?

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:09.270
Shoot!

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:11.170
I completely forgot about the training.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.120
Wilbell-san.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.180
I haven't even done anything!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.350
Wilbell-san.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:12.990
What do I do?

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.970
Wilbell-san.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.500
That's right!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.160
If I remember correctly, the Fire Lord lives to the west of here.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.350
Wilbell-san.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:22.840
I can just make a contract with her like I did with the Wind Lord!

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.110
Wilbell-san...

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.980
Yeah, I'll do that!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.720
And since I don't feel comfortable going alone, I'll bring everyone with me!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:30.930
You're awful!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.940
You tricked us, Wilbell-san.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.450
You even had Escha bring a bomb.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.060
It's not really a problem, is it?

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.810
Since you guys are so strong.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:42.610
Of course it is!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.480
Shut up!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.690
I am the one who should be angry now!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.610
I hate humans!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.410
Please wait!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.910
Why do you hate humans?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:58.930
We apologise for entering the hot springs without permission.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:00.680
Why now?

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:04.000
You're going to say that after you've stolen the fire from my altar?

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.800
The altar?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.090
Stole the fire?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.370
So this is the altar the Fire Lord spoke of,

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.680
from which the fire was stolen.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.710
It's broken and battered.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.310
This might be the work of ruin raiders.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:23.270
What's this hole?

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.350
This is where the spirit gem was placed.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:27.530
Spirit gem?

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.360
The stolen fire that the Fire Lord was referring to,

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:37.260
it was a gem that past humans would create in honour of the Fire Lord and place here.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:40.870
I heard from my great-great-grandmother that such a tradition existed a long time ago.

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:45.800
In other words, the things that humans made for the Fire Lord in the past,

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:48.660
were stolen by humans.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:51.880
No wonder the Fire Lord hates humans.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.390
I will make a gem.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.880
I want to help the Fire Lord.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:03.350
To be betrayed by the humans that the Fire Lord once trusted,

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.610
and to be hurt by them...

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.040
That is why the Fire Lord is so angry.

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:09.850
Escha...

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:10.810
Escha-chan...

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.880
But we don't know how to make one.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.190
What are you going to do?

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.100
I'll teach you the recipe.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.790
Wilbell-san.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:28.840
It's so ridiculously difficult to make that even a great mage like myself would have problems.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:34.500
But I'm sure you'll be able to do it, Escha.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:38.600
Will Escha-chan be okay?

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.280
Let's believe in her and wait.

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:44.370
We'll do what we can here, okay?

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.440
Linca, help Wilbell repair the shrine.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.950
Nio-chan, Lucille-chan, and I will clean up.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.140
Roger!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.820
We'll keep gathering.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.540
Please prepare the other ingredients, Escha.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.360
I'm counting on you.

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.630
First we need to start with the Purple Crystal.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.750
It'll be all right.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.400
If I focus, it will turn out all right.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.550
Escha, we brought them!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.140
Thank you very much.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.470
All right, this should be everything.

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:23.370
We'll leave the rest to you, Escha.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.310
Yes!

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.530
Please wait, Fire Lord.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.890
I'll definitely help you!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.500
Sorry we're late.

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:54.630
What?

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:57.080
Where'd everyone go?

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:59.270
Don't tell me they've been incinerated by the Fire Lord.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:17:59.980
Eh!?

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:02.290
H-How's this?

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.100
That voice!

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.900
Wilbell-san!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.730
Now it's time for the finale!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:17.010
Gaze at the blossoming flowers fluttering through the sky!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.590
Oh! Such pretty flames.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.730
Not bad!

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.330
As one would expect from you, Wilbell.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.040
How's that!

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:31.120
It looks like everyone's having fun.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.580
The Fire Lord seems to be in a good mood.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:34.590
Yeah...

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.260
Hey, you three, too bad.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.650
Wilbell-sama's magic show just ended!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:43.600
Heh, but I wanted to see that.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:49.390
Oh, is that...

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.020
I knew we could leave it up to Escha.

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:02.100
Please work.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:13.840
What's this shaking?

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.090
Everyone, it's dangerous!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:30.720
What is this?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.900
With this, the spiritual energy of my sacred grounds has been revitalized!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.000
Wonderful!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.940
My fire burns bright!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:46.160
T-There used to be this much fire here?

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:50.040
After the gemstone was taken, she probably lost a lot of her power.

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.810
Such amazing power...

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:56.040
As expected from the Fire Lord's sacred grounds.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.150
Allow me to praise you,

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:01.680
Miss Alchemist.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.850
You guys are different from other people.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:09.850
If you ever need anything, feel free to come to me for help.

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:12.350
Yes, thank you very much!

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:15.420
Well, that solves everything!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.810
What are you saying?

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:17.980
Did you forget?

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:18.580
Huh?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.440
The reason you came here.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.000
Go on and ask it.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.260
Marion...

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:27.160
Okay.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:33.370
Fire Lord, about the contract between you and me...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.750
You don't have to do it.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.770
I'll become stronger and come here next time by myself.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:49.580
So until then, please wait for me.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.920
Wilbell-san.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.000
Very well.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.370
I promise.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:21:00.940
I'll be looking forward to the day you come and face me.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:04.450
Thank you.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.540
Hot!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:18.080
Now then, we can take our time and relax in the hot springs.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:22.960
Fixing the altar made our skin all rough, so it's time to recover!

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:32.720
What?

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:34.730
Is someone over there?

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:45.240
Who told you guys you could come in?!

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.990
But we hadn't used the hot springs yet!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.910
Before we went back, we thought we could just take a quick dip!

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:53.620
Geez! Tell us beforehand!

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:55.580
You idiot, Logy-san!

00:21:57.770 --> 00:21:59.960
Why only me?
